# Invalid CMS Events are Failed one by one; the rest of the Batch still applies.
# Broken bodies and wrong callers are rejected before the Inbox.
@run = 1
@id = valid-{{run}}

### Mixed Batch: 202, only the first event applies, the others are Failed
POST {{host}}/cms/events
Authorization: Basic {{cmsUsername}} {{cmsPassword}}
Content-Type: application/json

[
  { "type": "publish", "id": "{{id}}", "version": 1, "timestamp": "2026-01-01T10:00:00Z", "payload": { "title": "Valid" } },
  { "type": "Publish", "id": "bad-type-{{run}}", "version": 1, "timestamp": "2026-01-01T10:00:00Z", "payload": {} },
  { "type": "publish", "id": "no-offset-{{run}}", "version": 1, "timestamp": "2026-01-01T10:00:00", "payload": {} },
  { "type": "publish", "id": "zero-version-{{run}}", "version": 0, "timestamp": "2026-01-01T10:00:00Z", "payload": {} },
  { "type": "publish", "id": "array-payload-{{run}}", "version": 1, "timestamp": "2026-01-01T10:00:00Z", "payload": [] },
  { "type": "publish", "id": "dup-key-{{run}}", "version": 1, "version": 2, "timestamp": "2026-01-01T10:00:00Z", "payload": {} },
  { "type": "publish", "id": " padded-{{run}} ", "version": 1, "timestamp": "2026-01-01T10:00:00Z", "payload": {} },
  "not an object"
]

### Read the valid one
GET {{host}}/entities/{{id}}
Authorization: Basic {{readerUsername}} {{readerPassword}}

### Empty array: 400
POST {{host}}/cms/events
Authorization: Basic {{cmsUsername}} {{cmsPassword}}
Content-Type: application/json

[]

### Object instead of array: 400
POST {{host}}/cms/events
Authorization: Basic {{cmsUsername}} {{cmsPassword}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "type": "publish", "id": "{{id}}", "version": 2, "timestamp": "2026-01-01T10:00:00Z", "payload": {} }

### Malformed JSON: 400
POST {{host}}/cms/events
Authorization: Basic {{cmsUsername}} {{cmsPassword}}
Content-Type: application/json

[ { "type": "publish",

### No credentials: 401
POST {{host}}/cms/events
Content-Type: application/json

[]

### A User on the CMS webhook: 403
POST {{host}}/cms/events
Authorization: Basic {{readerUsername}} {{readerPassword}}
Content-Type: application/json

[]
